{"parse": {"title": "“交响曲”", "pageid": 28021, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"“交响曲”\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/36/CurrencyItem-100701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"“交响曲”\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>“交响曲”</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-100701 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/CurrencyIcon-100701_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-100701_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/CurrencyIcon-100701_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-100701_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/CurrencyIcon-100701_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-100701_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#1701</div></div><hr /><div>以玻璃罐盛装的果实，易为言语所消融。可用于特别柜台兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">人人皆知这剂灵药。它醇厚芬芳，使不名一文者得名，令困顿昏沉者振奋，为天赋卓绝者更添光彩。其显著的优点，也正是它唯一的缺陷：随处可见。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">今夜星光灿烂·活动正篇</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "“交响曲”"}}